{"id":"n48300-2-6","stage":5,"title":"두들기다 · 打动","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48300-2-6-1","ko":"어제 만난 아가씨는 어땠어?","zh":"昨天遇到的那个女孩怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"만난","meaning":"遇到","explanation":"만나다：遇到；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"9","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만난","audio":"/audio/59a56b665b0716f1d6e1.mp3"}},{"text":"아가씨는","meaning":"小姐","explanation":"아가씨：小姐；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"아가씨","audio":"/audio/3c99ce3d4775969b8c09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65973","senseId":"1","lemma":"아가씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아가씨는","audio":"/audio/b8f6b089ed2b3a45a3b3.mp3"}},{"text":"어땠어?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어땠어","audio":"/audio/fd7f0c90fa72bdb46939.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"遇到","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"因有缘而建立某种关系。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"3c99ce3d4775969b","term":"아가씨","zh":"小姐","audio":"/audio/3c99ce3d4775969b8c09.mp3","entryId":"65973","definition":"未结婚的年轻女子。","pronunciation":["아가씨"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/911a74937a8c7b8217ea.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n48300-2-6-2","ko":"내 가슴을 두들기기에 충분할 만큼 아름다웠어.","zh":"她漂亮得足以让我心动不已。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"가슴을","meaning":"心，心情，内心","explanation":"가슴：心，心情，内心；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"가슴","audio":"/audio/1bfa2a79f54c02d83437.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62908","senseId":"3","lemma":"가슴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가슴을","audio":"/audio/442acbfd1984ceeec9a8.mp3"}},{"text":"두들기기에","meaning":"打动","explanation":"두들기다：打动；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"두들기다","audio":"/audio/6e9dff59d50f526443b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48300","senseId":"2","lemma":"두들기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두들기기에","audio":"/audio/3a597c2e89ba587f0eb1.mp3"}},{"text":"충분할","meaning":"充分，充足，足够","explanation":"충분하다：充分，充足，足够；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"충분하다","audio":"/audio/0e3ccf834eaa673e455d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72147","senseId":"1","lemma":"충분하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"충분할","audio":"/audio/3b765682c467f02f9ab6.mp3"}},{"text":"만큼","meaning":"表示前面内容是后面内容的原因或根据。","explanation":"만큼：表示前面内容是后面内容的原因或根据。","readings":[{"term":"만큼","audio":"/audio/85c802d46593624b33b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53008","senseId":"2","lemma":"만큼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만큼","audio":"/audio/85c802d46593624b33b4.mp3"}},{"text":"아름다웠어.","meaning":"美丽，漂亮","explanation":"아름답다：美丽，漂亮；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"아름답다","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71290","senseId":"1","lemma":"아름답다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아름다웠어","audio":"/audio/f2ff9f2f5612d15782e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"1bfa2a79f54c02d8","term":"가슴","zh":"心，心情，内心","audio":"/audio/1bfa2a79f54c02d83437.mp3","entryId":"62908","definition":"心理或感受。","pronunciation":["가슴"]},{"id":"6e9dff59d50f5264","term":"두들기다","zh":"打动","audio":"/audio/6e9dff59d50f526443b7.mp3","entryId":"48300","definition":"使感动或兴奋。","pronunciation":["두들기다"]},{"id":"0e3ccf834eaa673e","term":"충분하다","zh":"充分，充足，足够","audio":"/audio/0e3ccf834eaa673e455d.mp3","entryId":"72147","definition":"不欠缺，十分充裕。","pronunciation":["충분하다"]},{"id":"85c802d46593624b","term":"만큼","zh":"表示前面内容是后面内容的原因或根据。","audio":"/audio/85c802d46593624b33b4.mp3","entryId":"53008","definition":"表示前面内容是后面内容的原因或根据。","pronunciation":["만큼"]},{"id":"b39be518859c28e0","term":"아름답다","zh":"美丽，漂亮","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3","entryId":"71290","definition":"对象、嗓音或颜色等令眼睛和耳朵都感到愉快和满足。","pronunciation":["아름답따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a63ee9a5bf6238948e6e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.19,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=48300","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":152,"sequenceScore":3.0167,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["昨天遇到的那个女孩怎么样？","她漂亮得足以让我心动不已。","这么珍贵的东西，我怎么能就这样收下呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["昨天遇到的那个女孩怎么样？","她漂亮得足以让我心动不已。","这么珍贵的东西，我怎么能就这样收下呢？"],"answer":1}]}
